          <small>账号 ID：beauty_profile</small>
        </div>
        <em>示例数据</em>
      </header>
      <div className="account-profile-signals">
        {accountProfileSignals.map((signal) => (
          <div className="account-profile-signal" key={signal.label}>
            <div>
              <strong>{signal.label}</strong>
              <span>{signal.value}</span>
            </div>
            <div className="account-profile-meter" aria-label={`${signal.label}：${signal.value}`}>
              <i style={{ width: `${signal.strength}%` }} />
            </div>
            <p>{signal.detail}</p>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
      <div className="account-profile-summary">
        <span>信号摘要</span>
        <strong>近期带货密度较高，营销特征较多；主题仍保持集中。</strong>
      </div>
      <footer>画像由信号组成，不是对账号的定性结论。</footer>
    </section>
  );
}

